reet lined with modern buildings and minimal activity, emphasizing the character's sophisticated and cultural attire.  \n\n**Top right corner**: The side view reveals additional precision in craftsmanship, with the jacket’s contours highlighting clean, sharp lines and a tailored fit that molds to the character’s body without excess volume. The slight curve at the side hem of the jacket adds a touch of fluidity to its structured nature. From this perspective, the toggles on the jacket remain visible and catch light slightly, showcasing their metallic sheen and ornamental cord design. The trousers fall naturally against the leg, emphasizing their straight-cut design without unnecessary bunching or tapering, creating a balanced and polished look. The street background remains consistent, depicting more of the urban scenery, including faint views of traffic lights and parked cars.  \n\n**Bottom right corner**: The rear view emphasizes the jacket’s seamless construction and sophisticated tailoring. The back panel offers a smooth, uninterrupted plane of fabric, reinforcing the sleek design ethos. The shoulders are tailored to perfection, with precise stitching ensuring a clean fit that flatters the character's posture. The trousers exhibit an impeccable drape, with no distracting creases or embellishments, showcasing the overall polished appearance from behind. The urban street scenery in the background highlights textured pavement and shadow play from nearby structures, further enhancing the modernity of the shot.  \n\n**Bottom left corner**: The full-body photo captures the overall elegance of the attire. The interplay between the jacket’s traditional-inspired design elements and the modern tailoring creates a harmonious fusion of past and present. The structured jacket complements the subtly flowing trousers, offering a look that feels regal yet approachable. The toggles and metallic embellishments serve as focal points without overwhelming the outfit’s clean aesthetic. The mandarin collar elegantly frames the neckline, while the straight-leg trousers add balance. The character is situated against a bustling city street backdrop, with glimpses of pedestrians and shopfronts that paint a picture of contemporary culture meeting refined sartorial traditions."], "The image is a four-panel layout:\n\nTop left corner: The front view of the character shows a sophisticated ensemble with traditional and modern elements. The jacket is crafted from a structured, matte black fabric, tailored to perfection, featuring a high Mandarin collar. Four black cord loops secured with silver metallic toggles serve as closures down the center, adding both texture and decorative detail to the minimalist aesthetic. The jacket includes slim horizontal welt pockets on either side, seamlessly integrated into the design. The trousers, also in matte black fabric, are slightly loose-fitting with a straight cut, maintaining the polished yet relaxed style. A busy urban street, lined with contemporary storefronts, serves as the background for this shot.  \n\nTop right corner: The side view highlights the clean lines of the jacket's design as it contours to the character's frame. The Mandarin collar sits snugly around the neck, while the toggles and cord loops subtly protrude to add dimensionality to the outfit. The sleeves fall smoothly and end right at the wrist, offering an elegant finish. The silhouette of the pants becomes visible here, showcasing a tailored waistband and a gentle flow down to the ankle. The side pocket of the trousers remains discreet. The background features another urban street, where modern buildings and streetlights complete the environment.\n\nBottom right corner: The back view focuses on the neat construction of the jacket, which is free from embellishments. The defined shoulder seams and tailored fit emphasize the precision of the design. The fabric drapes naturally and cleanly towards the hem without any vent or additional details, maintaining the minimalist style. The trousers complement the jacket with their straight cut and seamless waistband, showcasing consistency in the overall design. Behind the figure, the street reveals gently curving pathways with sparse pedestrian traffic and urban landscaping.\n\nBottom left corner: The full-body photo showcases the complete ensemble. The high Mandarin collar and sleek closure system of the jacket pair seamlessly with the straight-cut trousers, creating a harmonious and symmetrical outfit. The proportions are balanced, with the jacket’s modest length extending slightly below the waist, while the trousers flow naturally to lightly cover the shoes. The fabric choice exudes sophistication and understated luxury. The city street in the background features a combination of bustling vehicles, pedestrians walking on sidewalks, and towering glass buildings, adding contrast to the refined attire."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 112, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 31, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "9f7b3215e6af317603056a9a1666bf6e83e28835", "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [33], "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [315, 113], "pos": [-5006.46240234375, -912.66943359375], "widgets_values": ["Multiple views, 2x2 grid, four-square grid\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 34, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyroll", "ver": "d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281ceca", "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [5, 111], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_nam